      "text": "This was one of the most interesting conversations I\u2019ve had in a while. \n Michelle Thaller a wealth of fascinating information about space, time and all things the cosmos.  And she\u2019s an incredibly compelling speaker.  These kinds of podcasts are some of my favorites \n\nopen.spotify.com/episode/46M\u2026\n\n\n\nJoe Rogan Recaps (@JoeRoganRecaps)\n\nNew: Joe Rogan leaves NASA astrophysicist Michelle Thaller completely stuck after asking her a deep question about the reality of time:\n\nROGAN: \u201cThe weirdest thin",
