      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T22:56:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "joe-rogan",
      "voiceName": "Joe Rogan",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Bad thoughts season 2 from @tomsegura on @netflix is fucking hysterical.  It\u2019s available now, and we have a new episode of the podcast on @spotify and everywhere else that\u2019s out now too.\n\nopen.spotify.com/episode/7lP\u2026",
