      "voiceId": "joe-rogan",
      "voiceName": "Joe Rogan",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Honestly I just remembered it wrong.  I was elk hunting when Jimmy Kimmel was getting people angry at him for joking about the assassination and blaming it on MAGA.  \nI would never \u201clie\u201d about that.   I just had a dumb memory moment.\n\n\nHenri Fjord (@henri_fjord)\n\nWhat a weird thing to lie about\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/henri_fjord/status/2040284737429012599#m",
